{"__formatVersion":2,"__revision":"553dcbf48f9767ba","__entryId":"tag","entry":{"sceneUI":["<div class=\"list-demo\" style=\"max-width:none\">\n      <div class=\"list-item\"><i class=\"mk-box on\" style=\"width:15px;height:15px;flex:none\"></i><span class=\"l-main\"><span class=\"l-title\" style=\"font-weight:500\">官网首页改版设计</span></span><span class=\"demo-tag blue\">进行中</span></div>\n      <div class=\"list-item\"><i class=\"mk-box\" style=\"width:15px;height:15px;flex:none\"></i><span class=\"l-main\"><span class=\"l-title\" style=\"font-weight:500\">支付流程走查</span></span><span class=\"demo-tag green\">已完成</span></div>\n      <div class=\"list-item\"><i class=\"mk-box\" style=\"width:15px;height:15px;flex:none\"></i><span class=\"l-main\"><span class=\"l-title\" style=\"font-weight:500\">年度报告初稿</span></span><span class=\"demo-tag red\">已逾期</span></div>\n    </div>","<div class=\"card-d\" style=\"width:100%\"><div class=\"cd-body\">\n      <div class=\"cd-title\">如何用 AI 规划官网内容</div>\n      <div class=\"cd-text\">从需求梳理到上线部署的完整记录，适合零基础。</div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-top:8px\">\n        <span class=\"demo-tag gray\">前端</span><span class=\"demo-tag gray\">AI 编程</span><span class=\"demo-tag gray\">教程</span>\n        <span style=\"flex:1\"></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">3.2k 阅读</span>\n      </div></div></div>","<div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:10px 12px;background:var(--bg-soft);border:1px solid var(--border-light);border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:10px\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">已选筛选：</span>\n        <span class=\"demo-tag blue\">近一周<i class=\"close\">×</i></span>\n        <span class=\"demo-tag blue\">前端<i class=\"close\">×</i></span>\n        <span class=\"demo-tag blue\">已完成<i class=\"close\">×</i></span>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-text\" style=\"padding:2px 6px;font-size:12px\">清空</button>\n      </div>\